      "note": "PreSonus StudioLive Series III owner manual (PreSonus assets), opened 2026-11-12: rear panel connections (section 3.2): 8 XLR/TRS combo and 8 XLR mic inputs, 4 TRS aux inputs, stereo tape in and out (RCA), talkback XLR, 6 XLR and 4 TRS FlexMix outputs, main left/right and mono XLR outputs, balanced TRS monitor outputs, AES/EBU XLR output, AVB audio network port (locking XLR Ethernet, modelled as ethercon/aoip), control network RJ45, USB-B, an IEC power inlet (type letter not named: iec-c14 assumed, plan assumedConnectors power-in) with a rear power switch; front headphone output; lamp BNC and SD card slot are not modelled. Modelled: 4 of 8 combos (as their XLR half), 4 of 8 XLR inputs, 4 of 6 XLR FlexMix outputs. Generic artwork only (content/generic-panels/<id>.json, drawn by npm run asset:panel): connectors, faders, knobs and screens drawn without lettering, no photo, no logo. Every port and control position is a guess (confidence guess) and the side profile is an estimate drawn from the three outer sizes (no drawing opened). Connector genders not stated by the source follow the convention input = female, output = male."
    },
    {
      "kind": "datasheet",
      "url": "https://www.fmicassets.com/Damroot/Original/10154/TS_StudioLive-SE-16_EN.pdf",
